  "name": "multiple_choice: Walt Disney Studios encompasses a collection of respected film…",
  "request": {
    "questionText": "Walt Disney Studios encompasses a collection of respected film studios --- Disney, Walt Disney Animation Studios, Pixar Animation Studios, Lucasfilm, Marvel Studios, Searchlight Pictures, and 20th Century Studios --- and has produced more than 600 movies since their debut film, Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs, was released in 1937. Data from a large sample of these movies produced before 2004 are available in the disney_films.csv file, including box office gross revenues providing insights into the financial success of Disney films across different eras. The data frame includes the following variables: title − name of film date − date of release year − year of release genre − category for film types based on shared characteristics such as setting, plot, characters, mood, tone, and theme (Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Musical, Romantic Comedy, Thriller/Suspense, Western) rating − Motion Picture Association rating (G, PG, PG-13, R) total_gross − total box office revenue (in millions of dollars) each movie earned in its original time period adjusted_gross − inflation-adjusted total box office revenue (in millions of dollars) Which genre has the highest median total gross revenue?",
